   "verify": "`python3 -I -c \"p=[0.159,0.840,0.001]; n=len(p); print(round((max(p)-1/n)/(1-1/n),3))\"`",
   "answer": "0.76. The diagram's 0.596 is not the documented formula; one minus the normalised entropy happens to give 0.594.",
