   "verify": "the script below. ```python import pathlib sizes = sorted(p.stat().st_size for p in pathlib.Path(\"docs\").rglob(\"*.x3d\")) print(len(sizes), sizes[len(sizes)//2], sum(s > 128_000 for s in sizes), sum(sizes)) ```",
