   "verify": "`grep -o 'setFriction([^)]*)' F`, `grep -o 'FRICTION_COEFFICIENT_2' F | wc -l`, `grep -o 'getLinearVelocity().length()>=t._minBounceSpeed' F`, `grep -o 'eventsProcessed(){this.matrix.setTransform' F`, with F the file above.",
