  {
   "@id": "drill/D-TRC-2",
   "@type": "Drill",
   "label": "D-TRC-2 Four claims, two wrong",
   "title": "Four claims, two wrong",
   "level": "L2",
   "task": "Save the spec as `spec.txt` and the four claims as `claims.json` (the fields are inventory XPaths). Run the check and say why claims 3 and 4 fail. The scene is shown so you can see what the fields point at; `python3 -I src/x3dtrace.py inventory scene.x3d` prints the same four fields.",
   "verify": "`python3 -I src/x3dtrace.py check claims.json --source spec=spec.txt` (exit status 1) ```xml <X3D profile=\"Immersive\" version=\"4.0\"><Scene> <Transform DEF=\"Pier3\" rotation=\"0 1 0 1.5708\"><Shape><Box size=\"0.4 2 0.4\"/></Shape></Transform> <Transform DEF=\"Deck\" translation=\"0 2 0\"><Shape><Box size=\"6 0.2 2\"/></Shape></Transform> </Scene></X3D> ``` `spec.txt`: `Pier 3 is a box 0.4 m x 2 m x 0.4 m, turned 90 degrees about the vertical axis.` and `The deck is 6 m long and 2 m wide.` ```json [{\"field\":\"/X3D/Scene/Transform[@DEF='Pier3']/@rotation\",\"value\":\"0 1 0 1.5708\",\"quote\":\"turned 90 degrees about the vertical axis\",\"source\":\"spec\"}, {\"field\":\"/X3D/Scene/Transform[@DEF='Pier3']/Shape/Box/@size\",\"value\":\"0.4 2 0.4\",\"quote\":\"0.4 m x 2 m x 0.4 m\",\"source\":\"spec\"}, {\"field\":\"/X3D/Scene/Transform[@DEF='Deck']/Shape/Box/@size\",\"value\":\"6 0.2 2\",\"quote\":\"6 m long and 2 m wide\",\"source\":\"spec\"}, {\"field\":\"/X3D/Scene/Transform[@DEF='Deck']/@translation\",\"value\":\"0 2 0\",\"quote\":\"the deck sits two metres up\",\"source\":\"spec\"}] ```",
   "answer": "2 verified, 2 check. Claim 1 is verified through `axis:vertical` and `deg2rad`. Claim 3 is `check`: the quote holds 6 and 2 but not 0.2, so the value is not in the quote. Claim 4 is `check`: that sentence is not in the spec.",
   "checkedText": "2026-11-16 `x3dtrace` dcba70d7, Python 3.13.18",
   "status": "ran",
   "checkedOn": "2026-11-16",
   "definedAt": "https://github.com/hagopjay/x3d.docs/blob/ff0565e5a248ca391d68527716a58a821f25d152/docs/learn/23-traceability-lineage.md?plain=1#L237",
