   "@type": "FailureMode",
   "n": 151,
   "label": "Failure mode 151",
   "failure": "The only exact collision test was head-on and axis-aligned, so a wrong normal or a missing tangential term would pass; np.linalg.norm and @ differ from scalar arithmetic by 1 ulp and 19 of 300 oblique pairs had differing per-step hashes",
   "fix": "Add an oblique exact reference and write the sqrt out when a trace must replay bit for bit",
   "sourceText": "[x3d.demo PRs #19 to #25, v5/ERRATA-v1-v4.md; C]",
   "definedAt": "https://github.com/hagopjay/x3d.loom/blob/ba301533d7b66eb8fe5e691524a551ef01c58de1/LOOM-v1.md?plain=1#L543",
   "line": 543,
   "quotedFrom": [
    "doc/x3d.loom@ba30153/LOOM-v1.md"
   ],
   "inClass": [
    "class/K2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "@id": "fm/152",
   "@type": "FailureMode",
   "n": 152,
   "label": "Failure mode 152",
   "failure": "A receipt number was read at the wrong state: MuJoCo's RK4 energy drift read 3.4e-6 because the stored energy is the last stage (8.86e-9 after mj_forward); a stability scan's 1.2e6 was the value at the first crossing of 1e6, not after 3 s (1e30)",
   "fix": "Say when a number was read and what the engine had computed by then; call the forward pass before reading derived energies",
   "sourceText": "[x3d.demo PRs #19 to #25, v5/ERRATA-v1-v4.md; C]",
   "definedAt": "https://github.com/hagopjay/x3d.loom/blob/ba301533d7b66eb8fe5e691524a551ef01c58de1/LOOM-v1.md?plain=1#L544",
   "line": 544,
   "quotedFrom": [
    "doc/x3d.loom@ba30153/LOOM-v1.md"
   ],
   "inClass": [
    "class/K1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "@id": "fm/153",
   "@type": "FailureMode",
   "n": 153,
   "label": "Failure mode 153",
   "failure": "A chaos horizon was credited to the integrator: both were accurate (RK4 9.4e-9 m at 3 s) and the 9.8 s horizon came from a 1e-9 model difference (body inertia) amplified at about 2 per second",
   "fix": "Horizon = ln(tolerance / initial difference) / lambda (8.9 s for 1e-9, 5.5 s for 1e-6, 2.0 s for 1e-3 here); run a twin shifted by the difference before blaming a method",
   "sourceText": "[x3d.demo PRs #19 to #25, v5/ERRATA-v1-v4.md; C]",
   "definedAt": "https://github.com/hagopjay/x3d.loom/blob/ba301533d7b66eb8fe5e691524a551ef01c58de1/LOOM-v1.md?plain=1#L545",
   "line": 545,
