   ],
   "inClass": [
    "class/K7"
   ]
  },
  {
   "@id": "fm/154",
   "@type": "FailureMode",
   "n": 154,
   "label": "Failure mode 154",
   "failure": "An explanation was written without a test that could tell it from the alternatives: \"the wave outruns a cell per step\" (c dt/dx was 0.83; the cause is the checkerboard mode, 0.7082), a float line that agreed with theory by two errors cancelling, a cannonball that \"grows without limit\" (it saturates near 12.9 times E0)",
   "fix": "Grade an explanation Suspected until an experiment separates it from the next-best one; state what would refute it",
   "sourceText": "[x3d.demo PRs #19 to #25, v5/ERRATA-v1-v4.md; C]",
   "definedAt": "https://github.com/hagopjay/x3d.loom/blob/ba301533d7b66eb8fe5e691524a551ef01c58de1/LOOM-v1.md?plain=1#L546",
