   "@id": "fm/156",
   "@type": "FailureMode",
   "n": 156,
   "label": "Failure mode 156",
   "failure": "\"Limits written before the run\" could not be shown: limit and declared_limit are written by the same run from the same value",
   "fix": "Commit the limits file first; the runner refuses to start if it differs from its commit and writes the commit and the file's sha256 into every record (x3d.demo v6 `tmp6.py`). The physics witness now checks that block (`PHYS_LIMITS_UNPROVEN`). Git history can still be rewritten by its owner and a commit date is editable; say so",
   "sourceText": "[x3d.demo PRs #19 to #25, v5/ERRATA-v1-v4.md; C]",
   "definedAt": "https://github.com/hagopjay/x3d.loom/blob/ba301533d7b66eb8fe5e691524a551ef01c58de1/LOOM-v1.md?plain=1#L548",
   "line": 548,
