   "@id": "fm/158",
   "@type": "FailureMode",
   "n": 158,
   "label": "Failure mode 158",
   "failure": "Two written predictions about cloth tunnelling were falsified (rule 1, written before the first grid: no crossings under 0.9 thickness of motion per substep, some over 2; the safe half held but a thickness of 0.2 spacing with 4 substeps and one of 0.1 with 16 moved over 2 thicknesses per substep and crossed nothing. Rule 2 broke at 0.72 thickness with 7 crossings)",
   "fix": "Write the prediction down before the grid, keep it in the notes when it fails, never wire it into the witness as a reference, and claim no replacement rule",
   "sourceText": "[x3d.demo PRs #19 to #25, v5/ERRATA-v1-v4.md; C]",
   "definedAt": "https://github.com/hagopjay/x3d.loom/blob/ba301533d7b66eb8fe5e691524a551ef01c58de1/LOOM-v1.md?plain=1#L550",
