   "@id": "fm/159",
   "@type": "FailureMode",
   "n": 159,
   "label": "Failure mode 159",
   "failure": "An integrator was judged from one measurement: symplectic Euler shows order 2.0 at T = 2 pi (a full period) and 1.0 at T = 1; velocity Verlet's energy error is bounded (0.74% over 50 orbits) while its position after 5 orbits is 0.61 off against 0.0022 for RK4 (283 times)",
   "fix": "Fit the order at two end times that are not both multiples of the period; report energy and position error as two numbers",
   "sourceText": "[x3d.demo PRs #19 to #25, v5/ERRATA-v1-v4.md; C]",
   "definedAt": "https://github.com/hagopjay/x3d.loom/blob/ba301533d7b66eb8fe5e691524a551ef01c58de1/LOOM-v1.md?plain=1#L551",
