   "@type": "FailureMode",
   "n": 72,
   "label": "Failure mode 72",
   "failure": "X_ITE 16.5.1 has no Browser.currentTime; a NaN startTime left a TimeSensor 'active' with no events, so playback froze silently. A repeat: kit/templates/KICKOFF-PRE.md already listed this trap, and the build skipped reading its own kickoff",
   "fix": "Read the kickoff's trap list before writing page code (step 1 is not optional for the operator either); use `getCurrentTime()`; refuse a non-finite start; test playback by sampling the routed field (Switch.whichChoice), not the button state",
