   "failure": "A plausible cause, tested and rejected: a ring 7 to 14 % fast was blamed on the non-periodic initial phase; making it periodic changed nothing. Two box sizes showed the real cause, the periodic images, which speed rings up (the backflow correction had the right size and the wrong sign)",
   "fix": "Test each suspected cause by changing only that (resolution, then box size) before writing a correction; grade a correction measured this way L, not C",
   "sourceText": "[Vortex Reconnection exploration; C]",
   "definedAt": "https://github.com/hagopjay/x3d.loom/blob/ba301533d7b66eb8fe5e691524a551ef01c58de1/LOOM-v1.md?plain=1#L478",
