   "failure": "One exception escaping an X_ITE field callback leaves the routing guard set and freezes every route in the scene (TimeSensor -> IntegerSequencer -> Switch stopped at frame 13; the callback never ran again)",
   "fix": "Wrap every field-callback body in try/catch; test a page's routes after a deliberate throw",
   "sourceText": "[X_ITE teardown F02, L2 in 16.6.1; reproduced C (L3) in 16.5.1 on the Turing Garden page, 5 Nov]",
