   "@id": "fm/92",
   "@type": "FailureMode",
   "n": 92,
   "label": "Failure mode 92",
   "failure": "My own hardening script left '}););' in the vortex page: the page never ran, yet every page-trap pattern rule passed it (a page that does not parse avoids every other trap). The browser evidence caught it",
   "fix": "Page traps run `node --check` first (rule js-syntax) and fail closed without Node; every edit to page code is followed by a syntax check and a browser run",
   "sourceText": "[x3d.STEM hardening, 5 Nov; C]",
   "definedAt": "https://github.com/hagopjay/x3d.loom/blob/ba301533d7b66eb8fe5e691524a551ef01c58de1/LOOM-v1.md?plain=1#L484",
