   "@id": "fm/93",
   "@type": "FailureMode",
   "n": 93,
   "label": "Failure mode 93",
   "failure": "A witness passed while reading nothing relevant: page traps over the Mashtots slide show's app/*.js passed (6 files, 0 hits, 0 field callbacks seen), because the X_ITE driver is an inline module script in stage.html and passes its callback by name (clock.addFieldCallback(\"stage\", \"elapsedTime\", onFrame))",
   "fix": "Page traps read the inline `<script>` blocks of HTML files, resolve a callback passed by name to its definition in the same source, and report `seen` (field callbacks, world loads, inline scripts); `--files` takes several globs, and the list covers every page outside vendor/ (law 36)",
   "sourceText": "[MASH2; this repository, 5 Nov; C]",
   "definedAt": "https://github.com/hagopjay/x3d.loom/blob/ba301533d7b66eb8fe5e691524a551ef01c58de1/LOOM-v1.md?plain=1#L485",
   "line": 485,
