   "@type": "FailureMode",
   "n": 97,
   "label": "Failure mode 97",
   "failure": "A bug kept on purpose is a control: the constellation's \"MSAA 4x (diagnostic)\" switch turns the stage black and back. Mean brightness went 61.4 → 3.9 → 61.7 here, and 55.2 → 1.1 → 54.6 in the delivery's run",
   "fix": "Keep a known-bad switch beside the fix, and use it as the negative control for any brightness or eyes witness: a check that cannot see the black stage cannot vouch for the lit one (law 19)",
