   "@id": "law/34",
   "@type": "Law",
   "n": 34,
   "label": "Law 34: Every result states its scope and its reproduction level",
   "headline": "Every result states its scope and its reproduction level",
   "text": "Say what it is not (CPU physics only, not frame rate); within grade C, say whether it was reproduced in isolation (L2), in a real browser (L3) or with a comparative measurement (L4); keep confidence in a source fact apart from confidence in its consequence",
   "forbids": "A pass whose reach is unstated",
