   "n": 35,
   "label": "Law 35: A signature proves a key, not an author",
   "headline": "A signature proves a key, not an author",
   "text": "Receipts stay unsigned until signing binds the validator build, canonicalization, report hash and scene hash, under an independently pinned key",
   "forbids": "Treating an HMAC with its key in the source, or a key carried in its own envelope, as proof of authorship",
