   "@id": "law/40",
   "@type": "Law",
   "n": 40,
   "label": "Law 40: A fallback must say so",
   "headline": "A fallback must say so",
   "text": "When the host refuses an asset, a stylesheet or a capability, the page shows that it runs on a fallback, and a review made on a fallback is not a review of the thing",
   "forbids": "A page that looks finished while showing a stand-in",
