   "n": 10,
   "label": "Open question 10: The 33 drafted upstream PRs",
   "headline": "The 33 drafted upstream PRs",
   "text": ": when to \"send\" the first three (304 tests passing together) [MC §9]?",
   "definedAt": "https://github.com/hagopjay/x3d.loom/blob/ba301533d7b66eb8fe5e691524a551ef01c58de1/LOOM-v1.md?plain=1#L597",
